---
module: spec_tree
func_id: select-func-id-range
---

***conformance tests***

# start-and-end-inclusive
In a tree with f1, f2, f3, f4 the range from f2 to f3 is [f2, f3].

# without-end
In a tree with f1, f2, f3, f4 the range from f3 is [f3, f4].

***acceptance tests***

# unknown-start
The range from f9 in a tree with f1, f2, f3, f4 raises `InvalidFridArgument` with a message containing `Invalid start functionality ID: f9`.

# unknown-end
The range from f1 to f9 raises `InvalidFridArgument` with a message containing `Invalid end functionality ID: f9`.

# start-after-end
The range from f3 to f2 raises `InvalidFridArgument` with a message containing `must be before`.
